{
  "plan": {
    "version": "0.1",
    "title": "从单位圆旋转到正弦曲线",
    "goals": [
      "理解单位圆上动点的纵坐标与正弦值 sin θ 的几何对应关系",
      "观察动点旋转一周时高度在 [0, 1, 0, -1, 0] 之间的周期变化",
      "掌握将圆周旋转运动沿角度轴展开生成正弦曲线 y = sin x 的过程与性质"
    ],
    "teaching_strategies": [
      "利用单位圆与正弦曲线联动画面，实现旋转运动到函数图象的平滑映射",
      "通过关键特殊角（0, π/2, π, 3π/2, 2π）的数值追踪，建立直观几何印象",
      "结合互动调节，引导观察波峰位置与函数最大值"
    ],
    "numbers": [
      {
        "initial": 0,
        "min": 0,
        "max": 6.28,
        "label": "旋转角 θ",
        "unit": "rad",
        "student_control": {
          "kind": "slider",
          "step": 0.031400000000000004
        }
      }
    ],
    "sections": [
      {
        "purpose": "在单位圆中引入动点 P 与纵坐标 sin θ 的几何含义",
        "reusable_items": [
          {
            "kind": "board_item",
            "board_kind": "math"
          },
          {
            "kind": "board_item",
            "board_kind": "note"
          },
          {
            "kind": "board_item",
            "board_kind": "visual",
            "capability": "unit_circle_projection"
          }
        ],
        "moments": [
          {
            "narration": "欢迎来到三角函数的世界。请看左侧的平面直角坐标系，这里有一个半径为 1 的单位圆。",
            "delivery": "neutral",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "visual",
                "timing": "before_speech",
                "content": {
                  "capability": "unit_circle_projection",
                  "parameters": {
                    "projection": "sin"
                  },
                  "numbers": [
                    1
                  ]
                },
                "role": "main_visual",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "new_region"
                },
                "reusable_item": 3
              },
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "intent": "观察坐标系中的单位圆与动点",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 1,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "圆上有一个动点 P，它与 x 轴正半轴的夹角为 θ。点 P 的坐标可以表示为 (cos θ, sin θ)。",
            "delivery": "patient",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "math",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "latex": "P = (\\cos\\theta, \\sin\\theta)"
                },
                "reusable_item": 1,
                "role": "derivation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 1,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "action": "point_at",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "reference": {
                  "source": "local_board_item",
                  "moment": 1,
                  "item": 1
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "注意观察连接点 P 到 x 轴的虚线段，这段垂直高度恰好就是角 θ 的正弦值 sin θ。",
            "delivery": "emphatic",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "note",
                "timing": "after_speech",
                "content": {
                  "title": "正弦值的几何意义",
                  "items": [
                    "单位圆半径 r = 1",
                    "动点 P 的高度（纵坐标）即为 sin θ"
                  ]
                },
                "reusable_item": 2,
                "role": "explanation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 2,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "after_speech",
                "intent": "聚焦动点 P 的垂直高度投影",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 1,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "purpose": "动态演练动点 P 旋转一周的高度变化，并展开形成正弦曲线 y = sin x",
        "reusable_items": [],
        "moments": [
          {
            "narration": "我们在坐标系中建立一个半径为 1 的单位圆。当动点 P 在圆周上移动时，它的坐标为 (cos θ, sin θ)，其中点 P 的垂直高度直接对应着正弦值 sin θ。",
            "delivery": "patient",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "intent": "观察单位圆上动点 P 的纵坐标与正弦值的对应关系",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 1,
                    "item": 3
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "action": "point_at",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "reference": {
                  "source": "reusable",
                  "section": 1,
                  "item": 3
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "现在，让动点 P 从 0 弧度开始逆时针旋转。随着角度增加，高度逐渐升至最高点 1；继续旋转降回 0，接着下降到最低点 -1，最后再次回到 0。",
            "delivery": "encouraging",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "animate",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "number": 1,
                "end_value": 6.28,
                "duration_intent": "extended",
                "easing": "linear"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "如果我们将点 P 在旋转过程中的高度向右随旋转角度 θ 展开，就能追踪出一条连续平滑的正弦曲线 y = sin θ。这就直观展示了圆周旋转运动如何转化为周期性的波形运动。",
            "delivery": "emphatic",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "intent": "体会旋转运动展开为正弦曲线的动态过程",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 1,
                    "item": 3
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "student_activities": [
          {
            "kind": "number_target",
            "prompt": "拖动滑块改变旋转角 θ，观察动点 P 的高度与正弦曲线上的点如何实时对应。",
            "hints": [
              "将旋转角 θ 设为 π/2（约 1.57），观察高度是否达到最大值 1。"
            ],
            "success_message": "很好！你已经掌握了单位圆旋转与正弦曲线的对应关系。",
            "hint_after_attempts": 2,
            "number_controls": [
              {
                "number": 1,
                "controls": [
                  "slider",
                  "geometry_point"
                ]
              }
            ],
            "value": 1.57,
            "tolerance": 0.015700000000000002
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "purpose": "总结正弦函数的周期性与值域，并进行波峰位置的互动操作",
        "reusable_items": [],
        "moments": [
          {
            "narration": "我们在平面直角坐标系中引入单位圆，圆上动点 P 的坐标为 cos θ 和 sin θ。请注意看，点 P 到 x 轴的垂直高度，正对应着正弦值 sin θ。",
            "delivery": "patient",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "math",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "latex": "P = (\\cos \\theta, \\sin \\theta)"
                },
                "role": "derivation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 1,
                    "item": 3
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "intent": "观察单位圆上动点P的纵坐标投影",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 1,
                    "item": 3
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "当动点 P 从 0 开始逆时针旋转时，高度从 0 逐渐升高到最高点 1；接着降回 0；再继续下降到最低点 -1；最后重新回到 0，完成一周的旋转。",
            "delivery": "neutral",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "animate",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "number": 1,
                "end_value": 6.28,
                "duration_intent": "extended",
                "easing": "linear"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "如果我们将点 P 的高度变化沿横轴的角度 θ 向右连续展开，就能得到一条平滑的波浪线——这就是正弦曲线 y = sin θ。旋转运动就这样转化为了周期性的波动。",
            "delivery": "careful",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "math",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "latex": "y = \\sin \\theta"
                },
                "role": "derivation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 1,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "action": "point_at",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "reference": {
                  "source": "reusable",
                  "section": 1,
                  "item": 3
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "总结一下，正弦函数具有周期性，最小正周期 T 等于 2π，值域在 -1 到 1 之间。现在，请试着拖动滑块，把旋转角调节到波峰位置。",
            "delivery": "encouraging",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "note",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "title": "正弦函数 y = sin x 的性质",
                  "items": [
                    "周期性：T = 2π",
                    "值域：[-1, 1]",
                    "波峰位置：x = π/2 + 2kπ"
                  ]
                },
                "role": "explanation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 3,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
